WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/analytics/components/review/PatternsSlide.tsx — a year-in-review recap slide rendering a
  `data: YearReview` prop through `useTranslation` + `useUnits`:
    📊 (spring scale-in)  →  title "Your driving patterns"
    →  card[ Calendar icon + "Favorite driving day" + most_active_day_of_week || '—' ]
    →  card[ Clock icon    + "Peak driving hour"     + 12h AM/PM label of most_active_hour ]
    →  3-up row[ avg_drives_per_week (fmtNumber,1) "drives/week"
               | round(convertDistanceFromSI(avg_distance_per_drive_km*1000, unit)) "{unit}/drive avg"
               | round(unit==='mi' ? avg_efficiency_wh_km*KM_PER_MILE : avg_efficiency_wh_km) "Wh/{mi|km} avg" ]
  KM_PER_MILE = 1.609344. distanceUnit ∈ {mi,km}; efficiencyUnit = mi?'Wh/mi':'Wh/km'.
  hourLabel: h>=12 ? `${h===12?12:h-12} PM` : `${h===0?12:h} AM`.
  The leaf component receives data as a prop (parent owns fetch); the prompt nonetheless mandates the full
  loading/empty/error/stale/offline state matrix, reproduced natively via the P1/S8 state-holder seam (same as
  the YearReviewWidget sibling which shares this DTO).

