STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces)
  loading  → PatternsLoadingChrome (TSSkeleton silhouette)        empty   → ContentUnavailableView
  error    → icon + title + message + Retry (model.refresh)        content → the full slide
  stale    → amber freshness chip + "Reconnecting…" banner + auto-refresh-if-stale (cached value stays visible)
  offline  → muted chip + "Offline — showing your last recap" banner (cached value stays visible)

